/var/home/charlie/.hermes/sessions/request_dump_mrw8lc7unh9ypw_20260723_001339_244936.json:869:          "content": "我已经先把**方案骨架和脚本模板**给你落到电脑上了，可直接在这基础上继续做。\n\n## 已创建的文件\n- 方案说明：\n  - [phone-sync-plan.md](/var/home/charlie/phone-sync-plan.md)\n- 手机端启动脚本模板：\n  - [10-phone-init.sh](/var/home/charlie/phone-sync/scripts/10-phone-init.sh)\n- 手机端快照采集脚本模板：\n  - [phone-sync-snapshot.sh](/var/home/charlie/phone-sync/scripts/phone-sync-snapshot.sh)\n- 电脑端导入 SQLite 脚本：\n  - [import_phone_snapshots.py](/var/home/charlie/phone-sync/scripts/import_phone_snapshots.py)\n- SQLite 数据库已初始化：\n  - [phone_state.db](/var/home/charlie/phone-sync/db/phone_state.db)\n\n## 这套东西现在能做什么\n- 作为你的**永久化手机同步方案骨架**\n- 手机端未来定时输出 `latest.json / state-*.json`\n- 电脑端把这些 JSON 导入：\n  - `snapshots`\n  - `packages`\n- 后面 AI 就可以优先查这个本地库\n\n## 你现在要做的最短步骤\n### 1）把两个手机端脚本放到手机 Termux\n目标位置建议：\n- `~/.termux/boot/10-phone-init.sh`\n- `~/bin/phone-sync-snapshot.sh`\n\n你可以直接把我生成的这两个文件内容复制过去。\n\n### 2）在手机 Termux 里给执行权限\n```bash\nchmod +x ~/.termux/boot/10-phone-init.sh\nchmod +x ~/bin/phone-sync-snapshot.sh\n```\n\n### 3）确保手机侧已装并放行\n- Termux\n- Termux:Boot\n- NetBird\n- root/Magisk\n- 关闭电池优化\n- 允许后台\n- 允许开机自启\n\n### 4）重启手机后验证\n在 Termux 看：\n```bash\ntail -n 50 ~/phone-sync/logs/init.log\nps -ef | grep sshd\n```\n\n### 5）手工跑一次快照\n```bash\n~/bin/phone-sync-snapshot.sh\n```\n\n成功后应产生：\n- `~/phone-sync/out/latest.json`\n- `~/phone-sync/out/state-时间戳.json`\n\n### 6）把 JSON 传到电脑\n先用最简单方式：\n- 手动拷到  \n  `/var/home/charlie/phone-sync/inbox/`\n\n然后电脑端执行：\n```bash\npython /var/home/charlie/phone-sync/scripts/import_phone_snapshots.py\n```\n\n---\n\n## 关键说明\n我现在给你的是**可落地的第一版骨架**，还没做下面这些增强：\n\n- 自动从手机拉文件到电脑\n- 包版本差异比对\n- 软件更新事件检测\n- 指定健康 app 数据目录同步\n- Hermes 定时任务自动导入\n- AI 查询接口封装\n\n这些我下一步可以继续直接帮你补上。\n\n## 我建议下一步直接做\n按优先级：\n\n1. **补自动拉取链路**\n   - 让电脑定时从手机抓 `latest.json`\n2. **补差异检测**\n   - 识别 app 新装/卸载/更新\n3. **补健康 app 专项同步**\n   - 针对“我我身体”做目录/数据库/导出文件跟踪\n4. **接 Hermes 定时任务**\n   - 让它自动入库，AI 直接可查\n\n如果你要，我下一条我就直接继续给你补：\n\n**“电脑端自动拉取 + 更新差异检测 + Hermes 定时任务”**  \n我可以直接把这三部分也写好。"
/var/home/charlie/.hermes/sessions/request_dump_mrw8lc7unh9ypw_20260723_001339_244936.json:944:                "arguments": "{\"content\":\"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\nimport json\\nimport sqlite3\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nfrom datetime import datetime\\n\\nDB = Path('/var/home/charlie/phone-sync/db/phone_state.db')\\nEVENTS = Path('/var/home/charlie/phone-sync/events')\\nEVENTS.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\\nOUT = EVENTS / 'package-changes.jsonl'\\n\\nconn = sqlite3.connect(DB)\\nconn.row_factory = sqlite3.Row\\ncur = conn.cursor()\\n\\ncur.execute('SELECT id, captured_at, source_file FROM snapshots ORDER BY captured_at DESC, id DESC LIMIT 2')\\nrows = cur.fetchall()\\nif len(rows) < 2:\\n    print('not enough snapshots')\\n    raise SystemExit(0)\\n\\nnewer, older = rows[0], rows[1]\\n\\ncur.execute('SELECT package_name, apk_path FROM packages WHERE snapshot_id=?', (newer['id'],))\\nnew_pkgs = {r['package_name']: r['apk_path'] for r in cur.fetchall()}\\ncur.execute('SELECT package_name, apk_path FROM packages WHERE snapshot_id=?', (older['id'],))\\nold_pkgs = {r['package_name']: r['apk_path'] for r in cur.fetchall()}\\n\\nadded = sorted(set(new_pkgs) - set(old_pkgs))\\nremoved = sorted(set(old_pkgs) - set(new_pkgs))\\nchanged = sorted(p for p in set(new_pkgs) & set(old_pkgs) if new_pkgs[p] != old_pkgs[p])\\n\\npayload = {\\n    'generated_at': datetime.utcnow().isoformat() + 'Z',\\n    'newer_snapshot': dict(newer),\\n    'older_snapshot': dict(older),\\n    'added': [{'package': p, 'apk': new_pkgs[p]} for p in added],\\n    'removed': [{'package': p, 'apk': old_pkgs[p]} for p in removed],\\n    'changed_apk_path': [{'package': p, 'old_apk': old_pkgs[p], 'new_apk': new_pkgs[p]} for p in changed],\\n}\\n\\nwith OUT.open('a', encoding='utf-8') as f:\\n    f.write(json.dumps(payload, ensure_ascii=False) + '\\\\n')\\n\\nsummary = {\\n    'added': len(added),\\n    'removed': len(removed),\\n    'changed_apk_path': len(changed),\\n    'events_file': str(OUT),\\n}\\nprint(json.dumps(summary, ensure_ascii=False))\\n\",\"cross_profile\":false,\"path\":\"/var/home/charlie/phone-sync/scripts/detect_package_changes.py\"}"
